  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Covid 19 Delivery Support (Needs Based Funding) (CDS-NBF)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will support the rapid scale up of COVID-19 vaccination through an intensification of the integrated COVID-19 and routine immunization efforts mainly focusing on the key areas of vaccine administration, safety /characteristics, demand creation, cold chain and storage requirements of COVID-19 vaccine, organizing COVID-19 vaccination sessions, AEFI Monitoring for COVID-19 vaccination, recording and monitoring. The vaccination exercise will be conducted through mobile outreach activities to locations linked to IOM facilities in Malakal, Wau, Rubkona and Abyei administrative area. Two vaccination teams each comprising of 1 supervisor, 1 vaccinator, 1 social mobilisers ,1 registrar and 1 crowd controllers (casual workers) will be deployed for each of the 4 locations.</narrative>
  </description>
